From: Roki Buildroot <buildroot@roki.local>
Subject: [PATCH] gstreamer1: build native GLib tools before configuring

GStreamer uses glib-mkenums while configuring and generating sources.  A
target-only libglib2 dependency exposes the target pkg-config metadata, which
makes Meson resolve the tool as /usr/bin/glib-mkenums.  Build host-libglib2 as
well, so Meson uses the native generator from HOST_DIR.

---
 package/gstreamer1/gstreamer1/gstreamer1.mk | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/package/gstreamer1/gstreamer1/gstreamer1.mk b/package/gstreamer1/gstreamer1/gstreamer1.mk
index 2a3575cc4b..ff5a455a0c 100644
--- a/package/gstreamer1/gstreamer1/gstreamer1.mk
+++ b/package/gstreamer1/gstreamer1/gstreamer1.mk
@@ -37,1 +37,2 @@ GSTREAMER1_DEPENDENCIES = \
+	host-libglib2 \
 	libglib2 \
-- 
2.51.0
